<!-- ========== ABOUT ========== -->
<section class="section" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <span class="section-label">Get To Know Me</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">About <span class="accent-text">Me</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-text reveal">
        <p class="about-lead">I'm <strong>Dinesh N</strong>, a passionate <strong>Technical Trainer & Training Team Lead</strong> based in Namakkal, Tamil Nadu â€” dedicated to bridging the gap between college education and real-world tech industry demands.</p>
        <p class="about-body">With hands-on expertise in <strong>Java, DSA, Python, Full Stack Development</strong> and <strong>Problem Solving</strong>, I have trained thousands of engineering students across 30+ colleges in Tamil Nadu. I specialize in making complex topics simple, engaging, and industry-relevant.</p>
        <p class="about-body">My journey started as a Technical Trainer, grew into a Master Technical Trainer, then Senior Master Technical Trainer, and now I lead training teams, design curriculum, and coordinate with college placement cells to deliver maximum placement impact.</p>
        <p class="about-body">I believe every student deserves <em>quality technical education</em> â€” and I make it happen, one batch at a time.</p>
        <div class="about-highlights">
          <div class="highlight-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Live Classroom & Online Training</div>
          <div class="highlight-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Curriculum Design & Content Creation</div>
          <div class="highlight-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Placement-Oriented DSA & Problem Solving</div>
          <div class="highlight-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Trainer Mentoring & Team Leadership</div>
          <div class="highlight-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Assessment Design & Technical Evaluation</div>
        </div>
      </div>
